# Console 0 at 60000/1001 frames a second paces console 1, nearly three
# times as fast at 60000/334, on one cable. Spans are not known in step 0,
# so console 0 waits there on console 1 standing at its first target, and
# the step runs again to the targets the spans give. From step 62 to step
# 332 console 1 ends each step parked on console 0, which stands at its
# edge, and runs on in the next.
console 0 core=test
console 1 core=test
option 0 link_test_fps 60000/1001
option 0 link_test_rate_0 60000
option 1 link_test_fps 60000/334
option 1 link_test_rate_0 60000
0 cable 0:0 1:0
62 save mid
62 checkpoint in_flight
200 checkpoint parked
340 end
